  "booster": {
    "name": "Play Booster",
    "description": "14 cards: 6 commons, a common (a Special Guests card instead in 1 in 64 boosters), 3 uncommons, a rare (75%) or mythic rare (12.6%) or a Booster Fun rare (8.2%) or mythic rare (1.4%) (paranormal frame, borderless Rooms, lands and planeswalker, mirror monster, double exposure) or a lurking evil rare (2.5%) or mythic rare (0.3%), a wildcard of any rarity, a traditional foil of any rarity, and a land (a full-art manor land 13.3%, foil 3.3%; a basic 26.7%, foil 6.7%; a common dual land 40%, foil 10%). Two commons have a lurking evil printing and eight uncommons a lurking evil or paranormal frame printing, each that printing 1 time in 4. Not published, so derived: the wildcard is a common 16.6%, an uncommon 66.9% or a rare or mythic rare 16.5%, and the foil a common 59.2%, an uncommon 32.3% or a rare or mythic rare 8.5%, as fitted to 196,824 opened boosters of the set in public draft data; within a rarity they follow the same odds as that rarity's own slot. Each booster also holds a token or an art card, which aren't game cards.",
